==Restrictions==
*This stage uses [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 1 deploy costs.
*Fixed lineup: [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]], [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Fish Cat]].

==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Catclaw Castle (Enemy Base)|Catclaw Castle]].
*9 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>.

==Lineup==
This lineup is fixed and cannot be modified.
