==Strategy==
This stage serves to teach the player about traits. Your lineup is fixed to a bunch of cats that counters red enemies. Keep spamming these cats and the enemy will drop like flies.

Alternatively, the [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] in your lineup allows for you to rush the stage down before the sir seal spawns, which can be an option if you don't feel like taking on the tougher enemies.

==Hints==
The first hint can be viewed within the Enemies Appearing window before beginning the stage. The second only appears as a defeat message when failing it.
*There are many types of enemies including<br>Red, Dark, and Alien enemies.<br>For Red enemies, {{Color|Blue|Axe Cat}} and<br>{{Color|Blue|Fish Cat}} are effective.
*Sir Seal and B.B.Bunny are Red enemies.<br>Fish Cat has a high deployment cost, but<br>is effective against Red enemies.

